      "premise": "Every sound is regulated for the sake of order. Ren, an Acoustic Auditor, spends his days dispassionately performing his duty: detecting and erasing irregular sounds—the so-called \"noise.\" But one morning, he encounters a trembling human voice streaming from the forbidden \"Dawn Radio.\" It is the raw resonance of life, a sound that the managed silence has long sought to conceal."
    },
